   "text": "On Campus Paris - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nOn Campus Paris\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nOnCampus Paris* offers high-quality university preparation programmes for international students in the heart of Paris. After successfully completing an OnCampus programme, students can progress to degree studies at a wide range of partner institutions—from triple-accredited business schools such as KEDGE, to globally recognised Fashion, Art & Design schools including Istituto Marangoni and LISAA, the largest design school in France.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 07:44\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 07:44\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nFrance\nYearly Fees\nMax: €28,460.00\nMin: €20,580.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n500 of 5,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nOn Campus\nFounded Year\n2008\nCampus(es)\nMarais \nCountry\nFrance\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n29/03/2022\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@CEG_OnCampus\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
